WEBVTT

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.880
<i>All things have a spirit.</i>

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.950
<i>Those who can call upon these spirits...</i>

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:44.020
<i>are called Summoners.</i>

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.850
<i>Since ancient times,</i>

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:54.570
<i>the legends of Summoners have always 
had a hidden place in history.</i>

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.060
<i>They summon the soil,</i>

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.020
<i>summon the dead,</i>

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.600
<i>summon souls,</i>

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:13.100
<i>and even summon the stars.</i>

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:19.340
<i>Yet legends will be legends.</i>

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:23.940
<i>There will come a day when they 
will all be lost to time,</i>

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:28.350
<i>forgotten by all.</i>

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:03.500
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:09.100
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:14.850
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:20.720
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:26.100
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:31.430
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:35.160
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:38.060
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.450
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:41.720
<i>No dodge</i>

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.890
<i>No surrender</i>

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:46.500
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.370
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:54.970
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:20.770
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.290
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.620
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.000
<i>No dodge</i>

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.450
<i>No surrender</i>

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:32.000
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.870
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:40.430
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:46.670
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:52.180
<b>Episode One
 The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:17.350
Hey!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.270
Miaowu.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.150
You climbed up there again?

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.570
You might not be able to get down.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:43.660
<i>My name is Ah Jie.</i>

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.500
<i>I'm 16 and single.</i>

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:47.350
<i>A junior in high school.</i>

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:50.220
<i>Don't care about grades, much 
less romantic relationships.</i>

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.780
<i>Every day I sleep, eat, and go to class.</i>

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.460
<i>The same old every day.</i>

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.440
<i>I don't have any dreams, either.</i>

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:02.060
<i>I'll probably find some quiet place,</i>

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:03.500
<i>open a CD shop or something.</i>

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.840
Hey,

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.720
why don't we play catch?

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.600
All right, you two.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.570
No running around.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:26.840
What did I just say?!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.020
<i>What a pain.</i>

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:31.060
You were doing something way too dangerous!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.640
<i>The one thing I'm good at is that</i>

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.820
<i>I've known how to take care 
of myself since I was a kid.</i>

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.800
<i>Cooking, especially.</i>

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:41.310
<i>Every single ingredient,</i>

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.260
<i>and every single step,p</i>

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.470
<i>call for absolute perfection.</i>

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.080
<i>My old man used to always say that</i>

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.900
<i>I'll one day become the king of ramen.</i>

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:05.390
<i>My mom used to say that not even gods can 
resist the temptation of good grub, too.</i>

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.510
Perfection.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.880
This might just be the 
best bowl I've ever made.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.820
Delicious!

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:33.060
I haven't had anything 
this nice for centuries.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:33.620
Hey!

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.270
Who the heck are you?!

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:38.440
My name is Dora.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.190
Huh?

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:40.970
My full name is

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:47.520
Hephaestus Aphrodite Athena Hermes Anesi...

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.060
Dora!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.380
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.770
<i>Am I hallucinating?</i>

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:09.020
<i>I bet it's because I got 
up too early this morning.</i>

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.400
<i>I must still be dreaming...</i>

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.580
<i>What are you, a ghost?!</i>

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.780
More specifically, I'm a summoned spirit.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.420
That just now only got me one-third fed.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:37.380
I still need even more strength!

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:01.430
Evil spirits begone!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:14.660
What a real handful this thing is...

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:16.960
All right.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:27.620
I've got three questions.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:29.540
One...

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.510
What the hell are you?

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:33.710
Two...

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.020
Why are you here?

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.570
Three...

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:40.140
How can I get rid of you?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.440
About that.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.830
It's a long story.

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:50.650
I'm a summoned spirit.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:55.940
I'm from an ancient era, a long time ago.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:58.160
That reminds me.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.520
I'm three million years old now.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.560
You can't tell, huh?

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.410
I take good care of myself.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:06.520
Right.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:10.100
The hottie you just saw was my complete form.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.900
It uses too much energy,

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.850
so right now I'm in power-saving mode.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.140
I digress.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.560
People have used food offerings in rituals 
to summon spirits since ancient times.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.040
Which is why I didn't 
come to you for anything.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.440
It was you who summoned me,

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.390
and woke me up from my sleep!

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:32.350
Summoners...

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.760
So, in short,

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:37.790
you gotta take responsibility.

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.150
Where are you going?!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.340
I'm late for class.

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:52.330
Hey! What's with that attitude?!

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.070
You've got to be kidding me.

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:00.350
I'm not getting myself 
tangled up in this mess.

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:06.840
<i>I'm hungry...</i>

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.990
<i>Here's hoping she'll have flown 
somewhere by the time I get home.</i>

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:11.200
Hey!

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.760
I'm not done yet!

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:25.270
I'm really powerful, y'know?

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:28.350
I'm a goddess!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.270
I can make all your wishes come true!

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.640
You plague goddess!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.270
I can grant you all the riches in the world!

00:11:41.670 --> 00:11:45.060
Or power beyond imagination!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:49.170
I can easily make you a rock star, even!

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.310
Join me,

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:57.520
and together we can rule the world!

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:58.930
I'll think about it.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:00.350
Catch you later.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:05.490
You're not getting away!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.680
Okay.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:10.520
<b>Class 2-B</b>

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.520
Let's take a look at this question.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.680
We have oval C, where C is

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:20.280
x²/a² + y²/b²  = 1.

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:23.980
Of course, a is greater than b,

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:26.720
which is in turn greater than zero.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:29.020
Don't run away anymore.

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:32.460
Make a contract with me.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:40.020
Ah Jie, Ah Jie, Ah Jie...

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.320
Enough already!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.160
Ah Jie...

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.160
<i>Crap...</i>

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:51.000
Do you have a problem with 
my love-filled lectures?!

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:53.460
Sorry.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:13:00.220
Quiet, everyone! Quiet down!

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:00.220
<i>I knew it. I'm the only one who can see her.</i>

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:02.970
<i>I can't let this continue.</i>

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:09.770
Now let's take a look at (m + n)² - 2mn,

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.720
and then minus two times...

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:15.200
...equals its fourth power.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:17.330
Let's take a look.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:21.430
Here, m²...

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.230
Looks like I got rid of her.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:38.470
Senior!

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:40.980
P-Please accept this!

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:51.170
Look! It's a love letter!

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.350
A love letter!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.590
So this must be youth!

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:01.840
Spring has come!

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.510
Hearts going pit-a-pat!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:11.060
Get away from me!

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:18.520
You are so rude to girls, Ah Jie.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.910
If I summoned you with food,

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:04.680
then I'll send you on your way

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.850
with even more food!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.630
Please!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.940
Leave me alone already!

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:18.110
So in the end,

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:20.520
this is still what it comes to.

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.430
Ah Jie, did you know?

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:28.240
A summoned spirit who doesn't sign a 
contract and is abandoned by their master...

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:34.770
is fated to wander this 
world alone like a ghost.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.450
For a hundred years...

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.390
Two hundred years...

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.380
Until they finally fade away.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.350
But that's okay.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.810
If that is your decision,

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.180
then I'm okay with it.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.390
Before I go,

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.310
I only have one last wish.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:03.960
I want to take a walk with you, my master.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.920
The streets you walk every day,

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.380
the shops you like,

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.020
the people you meet...

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.560
Everything I see here,

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.770
I will treat them as my most precious moments

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.720
and cherish them deep in my heart.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:24.330
They will stay with me during 
the time I have left.

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:33.640
Ah Jie, did you know?

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.920
The world may seem like a normal place,

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.660
but it has a lot of hidden secrets.

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:45.970
Now, I want to show you what this 
world is really like through my eyes.

00:16:57.170 --> 00:17:01.840
Why do some people have that 
smell, like trees, that calms others?

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:05.970
Why are pigeons able to find kind people?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.970
Why do drops of water keep themselves 
suspended midair for those they like?

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:14.560
Why can some people grill such great food 
that others tear up at their first bite?

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:18.930
Everyone in the world has 
the potential to summon.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:25.330
It's just that most people have 
never truly understood this world.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.840
They can't see it,

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:29.380
they can't hear it,

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.470
and they can't feel it.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.830
They only seek to grasp that tiny 
spark of light in the darkness.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:41.470
Only a few awakened people 
can truly master this power.

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:43.640
They are called...

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:45.780
Summoners.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.890
Summoners?

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:50.620
Yeah.

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.960
Summoners can do things beyond imagination.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:57.560
They can even...

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:03.680
destroy this world.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.220
Or maybe...

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:12.860
save it.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:19.110
Miaowu.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.990
No matter the path you choose, you can 
find who you truly are on your journey.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:26.770
Ah Jie...

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.740
Will you be a Summoner?

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:33.310
Will you explore this new world with me?

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.100
You fell for it!

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:08.090
I finally got you!

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:09.850
Now that we signed the contract,

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:12.560
you can never go back on your word.

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:14.410
You can never get rid of me again.

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:17.900
Serves you right for not 
reading instructions!

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.980
Guess there was no stopping you.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.600
You have a gift for this, y'know?

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.660
Your right hand by itself 
was real strong just now.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:35.110
If you used both your hands...

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:07.120
What are you doing?!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.810
The flying form uses too much energy.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.560
I'm hungry again.

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:19.330
I knew it! Not even Summoners 
can deal with your hunger!

00:20:20.470 --> 00:20:21.730
We're falling!

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:23.940
Do something!

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.030
Dora!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:35.610
Look on the bright side.

00:20:35.610 --> 00:20:38.220
It's a miracle that we're still alive.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:42.270
Just my damn luck.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.020
Forgot my electricity bill again.

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:55.640
It's fine. Just gotta get used to it.

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:57.260
Don't forget.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:59.390
You're a Summoner now.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.420
Fires.

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.560
This is the Glowing Light of Fireflies.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.240
Aside from illumination,

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:20.620
it also has a slow healing effect.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:23.610
Our injuries will all be gone 
after a good night's sleep.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:29.470
This really is amazing...

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.120
Be straight with me here.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.420
Where did you come from?

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:34.870
What's all this Summoning stuff about?

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:36.780
About that.

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:39.220
It might take me three whole 
days to talk about it all.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.530
Where should I begin?

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:44.640
Let's see...

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:53.680
Hey, what's wrong?

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:55.720
Hey! Are you okay?!

00:22:56.630 --> 00:22:57.430
Dora!

00:23:04.670 --> 00:23:06.270
This unreliable girl...

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:16.770
Summoner, huh?

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:50.740
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:55.980
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:23:56.510 --> 00:24:03.570
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:09.090
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:14.080
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:24:14.080 --> 00:24:19.080
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:24.070
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:24:24.070 --> 00:24:29.120
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:24:29.120 --> 00:24:34.120
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:24:34.120 --> 00:24:39.080
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:24:39.080 --> 00:24:46.530
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:24:46.530 --> 00:24:51.680
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
